(rectangle (start 22.86 91.44) (end 99.06 127) (stroke (width 0) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "e352dce2-fa9d-5f8d-beaa-6afdc6bf7d30"))
(text "ESD and detect (BOM v1 line 36)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 24.13 90.17 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ff59823f-0478-5e28-b8a2-0b8ee9f3358e"))
(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: 3.5 mm TRRS jack used as TRS (tip L, ring 1 R, ring 2 and sleeve ground; BOM v1\n   line 30); TPD1E10B06 on each output and the detect line (line 36).\n2. Absent state: passive. Plug detect: the tip switch (pin 10, normally closed to the tip,\n   UNVERIFIED by text) on HP_DET_SE, read by expander P10 with its pull-up on the host side.\n3. HPSE_REF_L and _R (DAC REFA, REFB and the SE references) each a separate trace joining\n   ground at the sleeve pin through a net tie (PCB-A-03, PCB-A-16, PCB-A-17).\n4. Open: RF filter footprints near the jack (PCB-A-19, Q2); the detect polarity (sample)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 140.97 0) (size 129.54 20.32) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4dd6a5cb-6b7e-5d69-a01b-12556be05d11"))
(text "Interface" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 168.91 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b0e9ff12-6730-59b6-84b4-bf005ce1ad36"))
